				c0-0.42,0.14-0.75,0.41-0.99s0.67-0.36,1.19-0.36H1092.97z M1091.77,124.31c-0.42,0-0.74,0.09-0.95,0.26s-0.32,0.42-0.32,0.75
				c0,0.31,0.11,0.56,0.32,0.72s0.53,0.25,0.95,0.25h1.2c0.43,0,0.75-0.08,0.96-0.25s0.32-0.41,0.32-0.73
